WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.160
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.430 --> 01:34.880
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.240 --> 01:37.789
[Episode 35]

4
01:47.910 --> 01:50.190
[Liao Dazhu, Company Commander of the 2nd Company, 1st Battalion, 4th Regiment of the Red Army, and Leader of the Commando Team]

5
02:16.630 --> 02:19.260
[Huang Kaixiang, Commander of the 4th Regiment]

6
02:21.570 --> 02:24.030
[Yang Chengwu, Political Commissar of the 4th Regiment]

7
02:42.660 --> 02:44.180
Commando team!

8
02:44.640 --> 02:46.170
Charge!

9
02:54.430 --> 02:55.750
Charge!

10
02:56.520 --> 02:58.050
Charge!

11
03:17.190 --> 03:19.130
[Mao Zhenhua, Company Commander of the 3rd Company, 1st Battalion, 4th Regiment]

12
04:11.430 --> 04:12.000
Stop!

13
04:12.150 --> 04:13.060
Drop your weapons and you won't be killed!

14
04:13.060 --> 04:13.510
Stop!

15
04:13.530 --> 04:14.030
Stop!

16
04:14.190 --> 04:16.230
Don't move! Drop your weapons and you won't be killed!

17
04:16.230 --> 04:16.750
Don't run!

18
04:16.750 --> 04:17.160
Stop!

19
04:17.440 --> 04:17.829
Stop!

20
04:18.769 --> 04:20.170
Don't move! Give it to me!

21
04:21.310 --> 04:21.970
Don't move!

22
04:22.360 --> 04:23.830
Which son of a bitch just shouted

23
04:23.830 --> 04:26.390
that he wanted to chat with our company commander?

24
04:26.390 --> 04:27.710
Step forward!

25
04:33.250 --> 04:34.520
Step forward!

26
04:50.270 --> 04:50.950
I was wrong.

27
04:51.159 --> 04:51.870
I was wrong.

28
04:51.870 --> 04:53.270
I was just joking.

29
04:54.310 --> 04:55.909
Spare me! Spare me! Spare me!

30
05:01.470 --> 05:02.630
Mind the discipline.

31
05:02.630 --> 05:03.290
Put it down.

32
05:04.760 --> 05:05.610
Take him away!

33
05:05.830 --> 05:06.190
Yes!

34
05:06.210 --> 05:06.690
Move!

35
05:06.720 --> 05:07.390
Get up. Get up.

36
05:07.390 --> 05:08.610
Move. Hurry up.

37
05:09.190 --> 05:10.020
Move!

38
05:12.930 --> 05:13.730
Yun Guichuan.

39
05:16.350 --> 05:17.150
Yun Guichuan.

40
05:20.380 --> 05:21.430
Yun Guichuan.

41
05:23.670 --> 05:24.640
Yun Guichuan.

42
05:30.930 --> 05:32.130
All right, all right.

43
05:33.350 --> 05:34.409
We made it through.

44
05:34.610 --> 05:35.670
We made it through.

45
05:38.770 --> 05:40.450
You did a great job, kid.

46
05:40.840 --> 05:42.460
You made it back from the gates of hell

47
05:42.460 --> 05:44.190
and made a great contribution!

48
05:45.040 --> 05:48.510
On the evening of May 29, 1935,

49
05:49.480 --> 05:51.310
the Fourth Red Regiment, after continuous

50
05:51.310 --> 05:52.950
fighting for more than two hours,

51
05:52.950 --> 05:55.390
finally captured Luding Town.

52
05:56.580 --> 05:58.370
At 2 a.m. on the 30th,

53
05:58.880 --> 06:00.760
Liu Bocheng and Nie Rongzhen

54
06:00.790 --> 06:02.810
led the vanguard of the First Red Division

55
06:02.810 --> 06:05.610
from the east bank of the Dadu River to Luding Town,

56
06:06.620 --> 06:09.690
and the two forces joined up.

57
08:07.310 --> 08:08.850
Salute!

58
08:20.360 --> 08:21.240
Comrades,

59
08:21.800 --> 08:24.200
please welcome Chairman Mao to speak to us.

60
08:33.390 --> 08:34.260
Comrades!

61
08:48.760 --> 08:49.890
You've worked hard!

62
09:09.090 --> 09:09.970
Comrades.

63
09:15.330 --> 09:16.520
Our victory

64
09:17.440 --> 09:19.300
has left Chiang Kai-shek's dream

65
09:19.490 --> 09:21.130
of turning our Central Red Army

66
09:21.130 --> 09:23.210
into a second Shi Dakai

67
09:23.710 --> 09:25.040
completely shattered.

68
09:25.880 --> 09:26.720
I know

69
09:27.360 --> 09:28.390
you marched 240 li

70
09:28.730 --> 09:30.460
in a single day and night.

71
09:30.650 --> 09:33.720
The enemy heated the iron chains at the bridgehead

72
09:35.000 --> 09:37.330
until they were burning hot.

73
09:39.000 --> 09:40.210
But you

74
09:41.330 --> 09:43.670
forcefully charged across these 13 iron chains

75
09:43.670 --> 09:44.390
and stormed

76
09:44.470 --> 09:46.110
into Luding Town!

77
09:48.160 --> 09:50.640
Everyone says this is a miracle.

78
09:51.190 --> 09:52.990
And I agree.

79
09:53.920 --> 09:55.090
This miracle,

80
09:55.440 --> 09:57.000
throughout history,

81
09:57.200 --> 10:00.320
what other army could have achieved it?

82
10:05.080 --> 10:08.550
The iron chains were burning hot.

83
10:09.600 --> 10:11.320
But our Workers' and Peasants' Red Army's

84
10:11.320 --> 10:13.480
fearless courage

85
10:13.880 --> 10:15.640
terrified the enemy even more!

86
10:16.000 --> 10:18.480
We want to use this miracle to prove

87
10:19.240 --> 10:22.470
that the iron torrent of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army,

88
10:22.470 --> 10:23.660
wherever it goes,

89
10:24.020 --> 10:26.350
cannot be stopped by any enemy!

90
10:29.900 --> 10:31.360
The CPC Central Committee

91
10:32.320 --> 10:33.440
thanks you!

92
10:34.040 --> 10:38.410
History will always remember you!

93
10:54.510 --> 10:55.630
Comrade Huang Kaixiang!

94
10:55.630 --> 10:56.270
Here!

95
10:56.360 --> 10:57.270
Comrade Yang Chengwu!

96
10:57.270 --> 10:57.960
Here!

97
10:57.980 --> 10:59.670
On behalf of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

98
10:59.670 --> 11:01.730
I present you with this award banner!

99
11:17.940 --> 11:19.070
The 4th Red Regiment

100
11:19.540 --> 11:20.950
truly deserves it!

101
11:23.110 --> 11:25.230
[Presented to the 4th Red Regiment for the Capture of Luding Bridge]

102
11:41.750 --> 11:43.150
Reporting to the leader!

103
11:43.870 --> 11:45.200
In the previous battle,

104
11:45.750 --> 11:47.270
we lost several comrades.

105
11:48.500 --> 11:49.630
Vice Chairman Zhou.

106
11:54.400 --> 11:55.920
The owner of this mirror,

107
11:56.870 --> 11:58.080
Comrade Huang Guifa,

108
11:58.550 --> 12:00.360
is on the list of the fallen.

109
12:02.430 --> 12:04.160
We can't return it to its owner.

110
12:15.110 --> 12:19.620
[Huang Guifa & Wu Yue'e — Lifetime Harmony]

111
12:30.720 --> 12:32.050
Has his body been found?

112
12:32.790 --> 12:33.550
Report.

113
12:35.530 --> 12:36.180
No.

114
12:39.790 --> 12:40.480
But

115
12:41.320 --> 12:42.720
every one of our comrades

116
12:44.150 --> 12:47.010
has filled a canteen with water from the Dadu River.

117
12:50.050 --> 12:50.900
Canteens!

118
13:42.730 --> 13:43.640
Comrades.

119
13:44.160 --> 13:46.280
You have a new mission next.

120
13:46.870 --> 13:47.750
Move out!

121
13:47.890 --> 13:48.610
Yes!

122
13:48.940 --> 13:50.940
All members of the 4th Red Regiment,

123
13:52.560 --> 13:53.560
move out!

124
13:53.920 --> 13:54.770
Commando team!

125
13:54.770 --> 13:56.030
Right face!

126
13:56.270 --> 13:56.890
1st Battalion!

127
13:56.890 --> 13:58.380
Attention all,

128
13:58.620 --> 14:01.150
right, left face!

129
14:03.830 --> 14:10.760
♪ A young man out there ♪

130
14:11.240 --> 14:16.120
♪ Is singing a mountain song ♪

131
14:17.210 --> 14:22.050
♪ A young woman in her room ♪

132
14:22.070 --> 14:28.590
♪ Is weaving silk ♪

133
14:29.960 --> 14:33.350
♪ I don't know ♪

134
14:34.820 --> 14:39.300
♪ Which family, upstairs or downstairs, by the ridge or behind the slope ♪

135
14:39.330 --> 14:41.210
♪ Which clever mother and clever father ♪

136
14:42.220 --> 14:50.610
♪ Gave birth to such a bright, quick-witted child ♪

137
14:52.260 --> 14:53.970
♪ Who sings such a fine mountain song♪

138
14:54.000 --> 14:57.600
♪ Which is clean and neat ♪

139
14:57.620 --> 14:59.580
♪ Piercing the sky and entering the earth ♪

140
14:59.660 --> 15:10.940
♪ Crossing the seas ♪

141
15:12.380 --> 15:20.050
♪ It makes the carp unable to swim ♪

142
15:21.280 --> 15:23.330
♪ It makes the yellow ox ♪

143
15:26.180 --> 15:39.300
♪ Roll down the slope ♪

144
15:41.700 --> 15:57.780
♪ I'll leave my silk unwove and listen to the mountain song ♪

145
16:20.370 --> 16:21.860
Comrade Chen Yun.

146
16:22.320 --> 16:23.800
Shanghai is thousands of miles away.

147
16:23.800 --> 16:25.970
You must pay attention to safety on the way.

148
16:25.970 --> 16:27.370
Rest assured, Chairman.

149
16:28.150 --> 16:29.200
Comrade Chen Yun.

150
16:29.340 --> 16:31.280
This time you are leaving Sichuan secretly.

151
16:31.280 --> 16:32.410
It shouldn't be made public.

152
16:32.410 --> 16:34.200
Comrade Bocheng wrote two letters.

153
16:34.200 --> 16:35.030
One is to

154
16:35.030 --> 16:37.120
his good friend Hu Gongzhu in Chengdu.

155
16:37.120 --> 16:37.960
The other is to

156
16:37.960 --> 16:40.350
his third younger brother Liu Shuyu in Chongqing.

157
16:40.350 --> 16:42.050
After you arrive in Chengdu and Chongqing,

158
16:42.050 --> 16:44.180
you can contact them with the letters.

159
16:44.450 --> 16:46.250
They will provide you with help.

160
16:46.520 --> 16:47.370
Okay.

161
16:49.700 --> 16:50.510
Here.

162
16:53.150 --> 16:55.150
[Chen Yun, Member of the Standing Committee of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee and Director of the Central White Areas Work Department]

163
16:53.220 --> 16:55.550
Comrade Bocheng is very thoughtful.

164
17:00.820 --> 17:03.420
Your way of hiding letters is quite ingenious.

165
17:04.390 --> 17:06.750
Your Qingpu accent is an advantage in Shanghai,

166
17:06.750 --> 17:08.750
but it's inconvenient in Sichuan.

167
17:09.030 --> 17:10.630
I have arranged for two local comrades

168
17:10.630 --> 17:12.050
to escort you out of Sichuan.

169
17:12.050 --> 17:13.880
Comrades, please come over.

170
17:17.240 --> 17:18.770
Hello, Comrade Chen Yun.

171
17:19.000 --> 17:19.720
Hello.

172
17:19.960 --> 17:21.089
Hello, Comrade Chen Yun.

173
17:21.089 --> 17:22.000
Hello.

174
17:22.490 --> 17:23.480
Vice Chairman Zhou.

175
17:23.480 --> 17:25.480
Your arrangement is so thoughtful.

176
17:25.540 --> 17:27.470
The help we can provide is limited.

177
17:27.510 --> 17:28.369
After leaving Sichuan,

178
17:28.369 --> 17:30.230
you have to be careful on your own.

179
17:31.120 --> 17:32.120
Comrade Chen Yun,

180
17:33.230 --> 17:35.720
after you get in touch with the Comintern,

181
17:35.750 --> 17:37.880
report our situation here

182
17:38.270 --> 17:39.800
to them as soon as possible.

183
17:40.260 --> 17:42.220
The focus is the Zunyi Conference.

184
17:42.750 --> 17:45.740
At the meeting, we criticized the comrades supported by Wang Ming.

185
17:45.740 --> 17:47.330
It is necessary to explain it clearly to him

186
17:47.330 --> 17:49.460
to win his understanding and support.

187
17:49.750 --> 17:50.550
Only in this way

188
17:50.550 --> 17:52.940
can we consolidate the results of the Zunyi Conference,

189
17:52.940 --> 17:54.680
which is also conducive to our next step

190
17:54.680 --> 17:56.810
of joining forces with the 4th Front Army.

191
17:56.810 --> 17:57.720
I understand.

192
17:57.770 --> 17:59.090
I will definitely do my best

193
17:59.090 --> 18:01.960
to complete the task assigned to me by the Central Committee.

194
18:01.960 --> 18:03.270
If I arrive in Shanghai

195
18:03.390 --> 18:05.320
and cannot contact the Comintern,

196
18:05.550 --> 18:07.880
I will find a way to go directly to Moscow

197
18:08.240 --> 18:09.570
to report the situation of the Zunyi Conference

198
18:09.570 --> 18:10.930
to Comrade Wang Ming,

199
18:10.960 --> 18:12.960
or even Comrade Stalin.

200
18:13.150 --> 18:13.990
Good.

201
18:14.440 --> 18:16.380
It's great that you have such determination.

202
18:16.380 --> 18:17.310
But this way,

203
18:17.340 --> 18:18.340
Comrade Chen Yun,

204
18:18.550 --> 18:20.880
you may have to endure greater hardships.

205
18:22.830 --> 18:24.420
We paid such a high price

206
18:24.550 --> 18:27.610
to finally achieve the results of the Zunyi Conference.

207
18:27.610 --> 18:29.500
My little hardship is nothing.

208
18:30.680 --> 18:31.920
This is what we Communists

209
18:31.920 --> 18:33.110
should look like.

210
18:35.320 --> 18:35.830
Take care.

211
18:35.830 --> 18:36.510
Take care.

212
18:38.840 --> 18:39.640
Take care.

213
18:59.510 --> 19:02.120
On May 31, 1935,

214
19:02.550 --> 19:03.880
the leaders of the CPC Central Committee

215
19:03.880 --> 19:06.080
held a meeting near Luding County seat.

216
19:06.550 --> 19:08.880
The meeting mainly decided on two things.

217
19:09.400 --> 19:10.030
First，

218
19:10.530 --> 19:14.150
the Central Red Army will march north along the snow mountains and grasslands,

219
19:14.150 --> 19:16.150
avoiding densely populated areas.

220
19:16.570 --> 19:17.370
Second,

221
19:17.680 --> 19:19.640
dispatch Chen Yun, Politburo Standing Committee member

222
19:19.640 --> 19:22.320
and Director of the Central White Areas Work Department,

223
19:22.320 --> 19:23.750
secretly to Shanghai

224
19:24.160 --> 19:28.360
to restore the Party organization in the areas under Nationalist control.

225
19:28.960 --> 19:30.360
The sun rises in the east.

226
19:30.890 --> 19:32.280
A new day has begun.

227
19:32.840 --> 19:33.790
I hope this time

228
19:33.810 --> 19:35.640
we can successfully cross the snow mountains

229
19:35.640 --> 19:38.160
and join forces with the comrades of the 4th Front Army.

230
19:38.160 --> 19:39.160
Our Long March

231
19:39.350 --> 19:41.030
has entered a new stage.

232
19:41.720 --> 19:43.650
The road ahead is long and arduous,

233
19:43.900 --> 19:46.960
but we Communists will continue to search high and low.

234
19:47.310 --> 19:48.030
Enlai,

235
19:48.480 --> 19:50.590
can we get some newspapers in Tianquan County?

236
19:50.590 --> 19:51.920
The comrades found some.

237
19:51.920 --> 19:52.840
The papers say

238
19:53.120 --> 19:54.910
the current situation has become severe again.

239
19:54.910 --> 19:58.450
The Japanese army's threat to North China has further intensified.

240
19:58.450 --> 20:02.190
[Peiping]

241
19:59.510 --> 20:01.440
The Japanese Kwantung Army has massed heavy troops at

242
20:01.440 --> 20:02.970
Gubeikou and Shanhaiguan,

243
20:03.460 --> 20:06.030
showing a strong posture of advancing towards Peiping and Tianjin.

244
20:06.030 --> 20:07.490
The Japanese Garrison Army in China

245
20:07.490 --> 20:09.650
has transferred troops from Tianjin and Tangshan

246
20:09.650 --> 20:11.250
to advance towards Peiping.

247
20:11.330 --> 20:13.310
Those two Japanese destroyers in Lüshun Port

248
20:13.310 --> 20:15.310
also sailed to Tanggu yesterday.

249
20:15.510 --> 20:17.480
They are really pressing us step by step.

250
20:17.480 --> 20:18.750
Is there a reply from Nanjing?

251
20:18.750 --> 20:19.270
Yes.

252
20:19.290 --> 20:20.220
What does it say?

253
20:20.440 --> 20:21.110
The reply says

254
20:21.110 --> 20:23.310
the policy towards Japan was already decided in January

255
20:23.310 --> 20:24.440
and has not changed.

256
20:24.720 --> 20:26.590
Regarding military negotiations with Japan,

257
20:26.590 --> 20:28.240
Chairman He has full authority to handle them

258
20:28.240 --> 20:30.970
without asking for instructions on everything.

259
20:34.720 --> 20:39.680
[He Yingqin, Acting Chairman of the Peiping Branch, Military Affairs Commission, Kuomintang Government

260
20:35.960 --> 20:37.480
The Japanese demand

261
20:38.000 --> 20:41.000
is for the National Army to withdraw from North China.

262
20:42.140 --> 20:43.660
Such a major issue,

263
20:44.590 --> 20:46.790
how can I handle it with full authority?

264
20:53.530 --> 20:56.190
We are not here to drink tea!

265
20:56.600 --> 20:59.510
Tell He Yingqin to come out and see me immediately!

266
21:08.940 --> 21:13.560
I'm afraid this is not the diplomatic etiquette

267
21:14.830 --> 21:17.550
Mr. Takahashi should have.

268
21:17.780 --> 21:18.540
You bastard!

269
21:18.570 --> 21:20.030
Takahashi, don't be rude!

270
21:30.210 --> 21:32.850
I apologize for the offense just now.

271
21:32.970 --> 21:34.770
I'm really sorry about just now.

272
21:39.000 --> 21:42.810
But if it weren't an emergency,

273
21:43.040 --> 21:46.250
he wouldn't have lost control of his emotions.

274
21:46.830 --> 21:48.240
If it weren't for the emergency,

275
21:48.240 --> 21:49.750
he wouldn't be so anxious.

276
21:52.670 --> 21:54.560
In our previous talks,

277
21:55.220 --> 21:57.180
we have already fulfilled

278
21:57.430 --> 21:59.170
the several demands your side made,

279
21:59.170 --> 22:01.360
[Takashi Sakai, Chief of Staff of the Japanese Garrison Army in China]

280
22:00.480 --> 22:05.070
including transferring the military and political personnel you requested,

281
22:05.000 --> 22:10.800
[Takahashi Tan, Military Attaché of the Japanese Embassy in China]

282
22:07.440 --> 22:11.330
ending the work of the Political Training Department of the Peiping Military Branch,

283
22:11.330 --> 22:14.020
transferring the 3rd Military Police Regiment,

284
22:14.020 --> 22:17.460
moving our Hebei Party Headquarters to Baoding,

285
22:17.480 --> 22:19.000
and so on.

286
22:19.480 --> 22:21.850
What other emergency do you have

287
22:22.090 --> 22:24.090
that needs to be negotiated with us?

288
22:35.210 --> 22:39.680
These are the four latest demands from our side.

289
22:39.920 --> 22:43.380
These are the four demands made by the Japanese side this time.

290
22:48.540 --> 22:49.190
First,

291
22:50.020 --> 22:52.260
abolish all party headquarters

292
22:53.090 --> 22:55.400
of your government in Hebei.

293
22:55.920 --> 22:56.880
Abolish all party headquarters

294
22:56.880 --> 22:58.300
of our government in Hebei.

295
22:58.300 --> 23:00.020
Require your side to immediately...

296
23:00.020 --> 23:00.610
Second,

297
23:00.640 --> 23:01.970
they require our side to immediately

298
23:01.970 --> 23:03.880
withdraw the 51st Army,

299
23:04.110 --> 23:06.440
and provide the withdrawal date.

300
23:06.880 --> 23:07.400
Third,

301
23:07.420 --> 23:10.650
have our 2nd Division and 25th Division

302
23:10.680 --> 23:11.830
withdraw as well.

303
23:11.850 --> 23:12.480
Fourth,

304
23:12.640 --> 23:15.770
have our government ban all anti-Japanese activities.

305
23:21.550 --> 23:23.310
Isn't this a bit...

306
23:23.350 --> 23:24.940
aggressive?

307
23:28.810 --> 23:32.640
I need to remind Mr. He

308
23:32.860 --> 23:35.650
that the above is the official resolution of the Japanese military.

309
23:35.650 --> 23:37.200
There is absolutely no room for concession.

310
23:37.200 --> 23:40.400
Your government should reply in three days at the latest,

311
23:40.460 --> 23:43.090
which is before noon on the 12th.

312
23:43.130 --> 23:46.920
This is an ultimatum.

313
24:47.240 --> 24:49.920
The Communist Army was able to break through the Dadu River this time,

314
24:49.920 --> 24:50.960
fundamentally,

315
24:51.170 --> 24:53.970
because Liu Wenhui was perfunctory

316
24:54.100 --> 24:55.300
towards your orders.

317
24:55.480 --> 24:57.590
His troops failed to defend Luding Bridge properly.

318
24:57.590 --> 24:58.570
He should be severely punished

319
24:58.570 --> 25:00.170
for letting the enemy go.

320
25:00.340 --> 25:02.010
Punish, punish.

321
25:02.200 --> 25:03.310
Yuanjing (He Guoguang),

322
25:03.310 --> 25:05.200
you chased them from east to west,

323
25:05.230 --> 25:06.880
from south to north.

324
25:07.750 --> 25:09.610
Did you catch the Communist Army?

325
25:09.810 --> 25:11.610
Aren't you still empty-handed?

326
25:16.230 --> 25:16.990
Yuanjing,

327
25:17.320 --> 25:19.450
I think what the Generalissimo means is

328
25:19.450 --> 25:22.300
that the key right now is not accountability.

329
25:22.510 --> 25:24.880
After all, the Zhu-Mao Communist breaking through the Dadu River

330
25:24.880 --> 25:26.440
might not be a bad thing.

331
25:26.500 --> 25:30.160
Right now, the Communist Army is in the bitter cold of northwestern Sichuan,

332
25:30.160 --> 25:33.220
separated from Xu Xiangqian's troops by the vast Tibetan area.

333
25:33.220 --> 25:35.640
It's all uninhabited, vast snowy mountains.

334
25:35.640 --> 25:37.850
It would be harder than climbing to heaven to break through.

335
25:37.850 --> 25:38.790
There is really no need for us

336
25:38.790 --> 25:40.160
to send more troops to pursue them.

337
25:40.160 --> 25:42.640
We might as well take this opportunity to free up our hands

338
25:42.640 --> 25:43.700
to manage Sichuan.

339
25:44.190 --> 25:45.030
You see,

340
25:45.380 --> 25:47.340
Cixiu (Chen Cheng) knows me well.

341
25:48.590 --> 25:49.960
Yuanjing, look,

342
25:50.150 --> 25:52.800
you are the director of the Staff Officer Regiment entering Sichuan.

343
25:52.800 --> 25:55.440
Don't keep your eyes fixed on the remnants of the Communist Army.

344
25:55.440 --> 25:57.500
You need to focus on the whole of Sichuan.

345
25:57.500 --> 25:58.700
If Sichuan is stable,

346
25:58.810 --> 26:00.240
the southwest will be safe.

347
26:00.240 --> 26:02.810
Internal stability ensures external security.

348
26:02.810 --> 26:03.400
Right?

349
26:03.960 --> 26:05.660
Yes, Generalissimo. Please rest assured.

350
26:05.660 --> 26:07.420
I will definitely do my duty

351
26:07.520 --> 26:08.790
and live up to your expectations.

352
26:08.790 --> 26:10.440
Don't be so nervous.

353
26:10.550 --> 26:11.960
The way of a general

354
26:12.830 --> 26:14.380
is to win hearts first.

355
26:14.700 --> 26:17.240
Remain calm even if Mount Tai collapses in front of you.

356
26:17.240 --> 26:19.930
Mount Tai hasn't collapsed yet, has it?

357
26:23.200 --> 26:24.130
Generalissimo,

358
26:24.660 --> 26:27.260
an urgent telegram from He Yingqin in Peiping.

359
26:37.060 --> 26:39.570
Shameful! Shameful!

360
26:39.700 --> 26:41.090
Shameful!

361
26:41.510 --> 26:42.510
The Japanese are now

362
26:42.510 --> 26:45.220
riding on our heads and shitting on us!

363
26:46.250 --> 26:48.900
He Yingqin took no responsibility

364
26:49.010 --> 26:50.570
and did nothing!

365
26:50.700 --> 26:52.110
He pushed everything,

366
26:52.170 --> 26:53.460
all the responsibility,

367
26:53.460 --> 26:55.500
onto me alone!

368
26:56.150 --> 26:57.540
Who can understand me?

369
26:58.210 --> 26:59.340
Tell me,

370
26:59.400 --> 27:00.980
who can understand me?

371
27:05.400 --> 27:07.980
-I feel the same way! -I feel the same way!

372
27:22.640 --> 27:24.000
Reply to He Yingqin.

373
27:24.920 --> 27:25.830
At most...

374
27:28.550 --> 27:30.510
at most

375
27:32.920 --> 27:35.180
agree verbally to the Japanese demands.

376
27:36.040 --> 27:36.800
Also,

377
27:38.330 --> 27:40.660
the withdrawal of troops from North China

378
27:41.000 --> 27:45.260
should be in the name of suppressing communists and transferring defenses.

379
27:45.480 --> 27:47.040
Don't cause any trouble.

380
27:48.240 --> 27:49.160
Also,

381
27:49.750 --> 27:52.160
that document previously drafted by the Executive Yuan,

382
27:52.160 --> 27:55.620
"Order to Promote Friendly Relations with Foreign Nations,"

383
27:57.750 --> 27:58.990
send it out now.

384
28:00.350 --> 28:01.930
Our attitude towards Japan

385
28:05.380 --> 28:06.900
is still forbearance.

386
28:08.720 --> 28:09.400
Yes.

387
28:12.310 --> 28:13.000
Yes.

388
28:42.590 --> 28:44.960
On June 10, 1935,

389
28:45.350 --> 28:48.070
the Nanjing Nationalist Government officially issued

390
28:48.070 --> 28:50.550
the pro-Japanese and compromising

391
28:50.550 --> 28:52.510
"Order to Promote Friendly Relations with Foreign Nations."

392
28:52.510 --> 28:56.550
The decree emphasized the necessity of maintaining friendly relations with Japan,

393
28:56.550 --> 28:59.310
prohibited the publication of anti-Japanese and patriotic speeches,

394
28:59.310 --> 29:01.720
and banned the organization of anti-Japanese groups.

395
29:01.720 --> 29:04.000
It stressed that any violations

396
29:04.510 --> 29:06.110
would be severely punished.

397
29:10.200 --> 29:12.920
Starting from June 3, 1935,

398
29:13.270 --> 29:15.650
the Central Red Army divided into three routes

399
29:15.650 --> 29:17.200
and advanced towards the Tianquan

400
29:17.200 --> 29:19.570
and Lushan areas northeast of Luding.

401
29:20.400 --> 29:21.440
Meanwhile,

402
29:21.880 --> 29:25.200
to support the Central Red Army's northward march, the 4th Front Army

403
29:25.200 --> 29:26.660
also rapidly moved south,

404
29:26.960 --> 29:28.630
successively occupying Xuecheng,

405
29:28.630 --> 29:29.560
Zagunao,

406
29:29.680 --> 29:32.400
southern Songpan, Zhenjiangguan, and other places.

407
29:32.400 --> 29:33.510
Given that the Sichuan Army

408
29:33.510 --> 29:36.270
had already deployed heavy troops in the Hanyuan area,

409
29:36.270 --> 29:37.830
the Central Revolutionary Military Commission decided

410
29:37.830 --> 29:40.510
to abandon the main road through Ya'an and Hanyuan.

411
29:40.510 --> 29:43.510
The entire army changed to a small path heading northeast,

412
29:43.510 --> 29:46.590
embarking on a difficult journey

413
29:46.590 --> 29:48.720
to join forces with the 4th Front Army.

414
29:59.880 --> 30:00.790
Warm.

415
30:02.830 --> 30:03.560
Say it again!

416
30:03.570 --> 30:04.480
Warm.

417
30:07.270 --> 30:09.350
Write down whatever you see.

418
30:09.510 --> 30:10.770
Always keep learning.

419
30:10.780 --> 30:11.920
If you see a mountain, write "mountain."

420
30:11.920 --> 30:13.350
If you see a river, write "river."

421
30:13.350 --> 30:14.880
If you see red, write "red."

422
30:15.000 --> 30:16.800
If you see green, write "green."

423
30:17.550 --> 30:18.830
-Okay. -Okay.

424
30:19.030 --> 30:20.070
Now I will check

425
30:20.070 --> 30:21.570
your homework from the past few days.

426
30:21.570 --> 30:22.830
Commander-in-Chief.

427
30:22.960 --> 30:24.920
Look, are these wild vegetables okay?

428
30:24.920 --> 30:25.600
Great.

429
30:27.340 --> 30:28.200
Comrade Luofu.

430
30:28.870 --> 30:29.550
Quick, it's biting me.

431
30:29.550 --> 30:30.270
Quick.

432
30:30.440 --> 30:31.030
Quick.

433
30:31.200 --> 30:31.680
What's wrong?

434
30:31.680 --> 30:33.000
It's biting me. It's biting me.

435
30:33.000 --> 30:33.720
Very good.

436
30:34.680 --> 30:35.640
Coming. Coming.

437
30:35.960 --> 30:36.960
I saw that.

438
30:37.110 --> 30:37.920
On the back.

439
30:38.070 --> 30:38.590
Very good.

440
30:38.590 --> 30:39.750
Let me see.

441
30:39.910 --> 30:40.740
Which side?

442
30:43.030 --> 30:43.750
Changbao.

443
30:44.210 --> 30:45.860
What character is this?

444
30:46.400 --> 30:47.110
"Listen."

445
30:47.550 --> 30:48.350
"Listen"?

446
30:49.080 --> 30:50.830
You put the ear on the wrong side.

447
30:50.830 --> 30:51.440
For the character "listen,"

448
30:51.440 --> 30:53.110
is the ear on the left or the right?

449
30:53.110 --> 30:54.310
Rewrite it ten times.

450
30:55.090 --> 30:55.650
Yes.

451
30:58.980 --> 31:00.780
Look, there's still blood in it.

452
31:00.960 --> 31:02.560
The blood of the revolution.

453
31:04.540 --> 31:06.750
Why did you write the character for "frost"?

454
31:06.750 --> 31:08.200
There's a snow mountain ahead.

455
31:08.200 --> 31:09.400
I've never seen snow,

456
31:09.610 --> 31:11.920
but I think snow is also white,

457
31:12.030 --> 31:13.830
so it should be similar to frost.

458
31:15.000 --> 31:15.640
Very good.

459
31:15.750 --> 31:17.610
We are about to cross the snow mountain.

460
31:17.610 --> 31:18.440
Those who haven't seen snow,

461
31:18.440 --> 31:19.550
or a snow mountain,

462
31:19.640 --> 31:20.510
imagine it.

463
31:20.750 --> 31:22.350
What does it look like in your mind?

464
31:22.350 --> 31:23.200
Write it down.

465
31:23.310 --> 31:24.480
I'll check your homework later.

466
31:24.480 --> 31:25.200
Okay.

467
31:30.160 --> 31:31.070
Flour!

468
31:31.310 --> 31:32.310
Sugar! Sugar!

469
31:32.330 --> 31:33.640
-Radishes! -Eggs, gauze.

470
31:33.640 --> 31:34.270
Wool.

471
31:34.350 --> 31:35.880
-Sheep, big sheep. -Sweet potatoes.

472
31:35.880 --> 31:37.340
Are sweet potatoes white?

473
31:38.030 --> 31:38.630
Bird poop!

474
31:38.830 --> 31:39.070
Okay.

475
31:39.070 --> 31:40.270
Is all bird poop white?

476
31:40.270 --> 31:41.070
Bird poop.

477
31:41.200 --> 31:42.240
Yes.

478
31:42.550 --> 31:44.550
There are also red radishes and white radishes.

479
31:44.550 --> 31:46.110
Cotton. Cotton.

480
31:46.200 --> 31:47.400
Zunyi mutton noodle!

481
31:49.060 --> 31:51.030
And Changfeng's big white teeth!

482
31:54.680 --> 31:56.140
Do you have anything else?

483
31:56.750 --> 31:58.160
Did you think of something else?

484
31:58.160 --> 31:58.750
Don't let him see. Don't let him see.

485
31:58.750 --> 32:00.160
Did you think of something else?

486
32:00.160 --> 32:01.010
Changbao!

487
32:02.160 --> 32:03.550
Can't you think of even one?

488
32:03.550 --> 32:05.460
They said everything I thought of.

489
32:05.460 --> 32:06.720
Let me think some more, Chairman.

490
32:06.720 --> 32:07.510
You must think of one!

491
32:07.510 --> 32:08.160
Okay.

492
32:10.150 --> 32:11.080
Let me see yours.

493
32:11.090 --> 32:12.020
Let me see yours.

494
32:12.240 --> 32:12.930
Changfeng.

495
32:13.060 --> 32:13.990
I won't show you.

496
32:14.750 --> 32:15.540
Let me see what you wrote.

497
32:15.540 --> 32:17.430
I'll show you how to write "warm"!

498
32:17.510 --> 32:18.910
Let me see what you wrote.

499
32:19.350 --> 32:20.240
Let me see.

500
32:22.310 --> 32:23.200
I don't want it anymore.

501
32:23.200 --> 32:24.860
I don't need you guys anymore.

502
32:26.240 --> 32:27.000
Take cover quickly!

503
32:27.000 --> 32:28.400
Take cover! Hide quickly!

504
32:28.400 --> 32:29.530
Take cover quickly!

505
32:29.830 --> 32:30.680
Take cover!

506
32:31.750 --> 32:34.070
-Take cover quickly! -Take cover! Take cover!

507
32:34.070 --> 32:34.920
Hide quickly!

508
32:35.110 --> 32:36.370
Protect the Chairman!

509
32:42.240 --> 32:44.270
Hide quickly! Be careful!

510
32:44.270 --> 32:45.160
Everyone, take cover!

511
32:45.160 --> 32:47.000
-Chairman, take cover! -Hide!

512
32:50.880 --> 32:52.270
Take cover!

513
32:52.750 --> 32:53.410
Take cover!

514
33:10.090 --> 33:11.440
Chairman!

515
33:11.830 --> 33:12.310
Go!

516
33:13.000 --> 33:13.480
Go!

517
33:14.440 --> 33:14.920
Go!

518
33:38.230 --> 33:41.210
[Hu Changbao, Squad Leader of Mao Zedong's Guard Squad]

519
33:51.240 --> 33:52.350
Changbao!

520
33:52.430 --> 33:53.560
Squad Leader!

521
33:54.460 --> 33:55.180
Changbao.

522
33:56.310 --> 33:58.910
Chairman, I can't walk anymore.

523
33:59.060 --> 34:00.390
Don't speak, Changbao.

524
34:00.510 --> 34:01.550
Medic!

525
34:01.570 --> 34:04.700
Medic! Medic! Medic!

526
34:04.790 --> 34:05.390
Changbao.

527
34:05.640 --> 34:07.920
Chairman Mao, tell my parents

528
34:08.480 --> 34:10.070
that I participated in the Long March.

529
34:10.070 --> 34:13.510
My home is in Ji'an, Jiangxi.

530
34:17.190 --> 34:18.190
Squad Leader!

531
35:22.330 --> 35:23.000
Let's go.

532
35:23.140 --> 35:25.060
The enemy planes might come back.

533
35:40.900 --> 35:41.780
Give it to me.

534
35:48.230 --> 35:49.100
Give me a hand.

535
36:19.270 --> 36:20.070
Changfeng.

536
36:21.960 --> 36:23.360
What did Changbao write?

537
36:25.340 --> 36:26.800
That assignment just now,

538
36:27.360 --> 36:29.220
what did he write in his notebook?

539
36:38.700 --> 36:41.490
[White]

540
36:50.560 --> 36:52.080
He only wrote "white."

541
37:16.230 --> 37:17.100
Changbao.

542
37:18.130 --> 37:20.250
The sun is setting.

543
37:21.590 --> 37:23.120
It's cold in the mountains.

544
37:24.310 --> 37:26.640
I won't fight you for the blanket anymore.

545
37:32.160 --> 37:33.280
Keep me company...

546
37:35.670 --> 37:36.730
Keep me company...

547
37:38.950 --> 37:40.280
for another cigarette.

548
38:14.990 --> 38:20.010
[Headquarters of the 4th Front Army, Maoxian, Sichuan]

549
38:16.420 --> 38:17.130
Comrades.

550
38:17.160 --> 38:19.310
Comrades, listen to me.

551
38:19.370 --> 38:21.520
As long as it's something

552
38:21.550 --> 38:23.070
our comrades in the Central Red Army can use,

553
38:23.070 --> 38:24.270
you can donate it all.

554
38:24.760 --> 38:25.550
Don't rush.

555
38:27.440 --> 38:28.230
Here.

556
38:28.840 --> 38:30.110
Here, give it to me.

557
38:31.520 --> 38:33.070
Comrades who have finished donating,

558
38:33.070 --> 38:35.110
go over there to get some yarn.

559
38:35.770 --> 38:36.370
Then

560
38:36.400 --> 38:38.190
you can knit them into sweaters, vests,

561
38:38.190 --> 38:39.000
and socks,

562
38:39.110 --> 38:40.170
and bring them back.

563
38:40.170 --> 38:40.960
We will give them to our big brothers

564
38:40.960 --> 38:43.110
in the Central Red Army together.

565
38:43.550 --> 38:44.760
Comrade of the Red Army,

566
38:44.760 --> 38:45.820
do you accept this?

567
38:45.960 --> 38:46.710
Auntie.

568
38:46.710 --> 38:48.300
It's not easy to save up for a quilt.

569
38:48.300 --> 38:50.230
You should keep this for yourself.

570
38:50.630 --> 38:52.070
It's just a little token of my appreciation.

571
38:52.070 --> 38:52.480
Auntie.

572
38:52.340 --> 38:54.730
[Zhang Qinqiu, Commander and Political Commissar of the Women's Independent Regiment of the 4th Front Army

573
38:52.480 --> 38:53.150
Please accept it.

574
38:53.150 --> 38:54.110
We appreciate

575
38:54.190 --> 38:55.480
your kindness.

576
39:01.290 --> 39:02.480
Turn left!

577
39:05.020 --> 39:06.500
Make way!

578
39:07.470 --> 39:09.380
Okay, come on.

579
39:10.170 --> 39:10.990
Unload the cart.

580
39:10.990 --> 39:11.610
Coming.

581
39:11.730 --> 39:12.250
Unload.

582
39:14.030 --> 39:15.000
Zhang Side!

583
39:14.600 --> 39:17.660
[Zhang Side, Soldier of the 4th Front Army]

584
39:16.110 --> 39:17.400
What's wrong, Squad Leader?

585
39:17.400 --> 39:19.800
Take a rest after unloading this cart!

586
39:19.970 --> 39:21.710
You haven't rested for a day and a night!

587
39:21.710 --> 39:22.630
That won't do!

588
39:21.770 --> 39:23.430
[Liu Xicai, Squad Leader, the 4th Front Army]

589
39:23.710 --> 39:25.230
The Central Red Army has many people.

590
39:25.230 --> 39:26.510
We need to boil more salt

591
39:26.510 --> 39:28.710
and give it to them.

592
39:29.170 --> 39:31.560
Eat something before you continue!

593
39:32.000 --> 39:33.800
Look who's talking, Squad Leader.

594
39:33.800 --> 39:35.260
You haven't eaten either.

595
39:35.440 --> 39:36.320
Take a rest

596
39:36.480 --> 39:37.510
and eat something.

597
39:37.510 --> 39:40.240
It's not too late for me to eat after I finish this.

598
39:43.400 --> 39:44.880
Brother, brother!

599
39:47.320 --> 39:49.510
Regiment Commander Zhang, my brother is here!

600
39:49.510 --> 39:50.480
Go quickly.

601
39:51.430 --> 39:52.280
Give me a hand.

602
39:52.310 --> 39:52.830
Okay.

603
39:53.060 --> 39:54.460
This is for getting yarn.

604
39:54.930 --> 39:55.740
Don't rush!

605
39:55.770 --> 39:56.440
Brother!

606
39:57.270 --> 39:58.420
Brother!

607
39:58.990 --> 39:59.820
Brother!

608
40:04.150 --> 40:05.710
Ximei!

609
40:06.280 --> 40:07.570
It's been half a year since I saw you,

610
40:07.570 --> 40:10.810
and you've grown so much taller!

611
40:11.550 --> 40:13.940
You only grew taller, but didn't gain any weight.

612
40:13.940 --> 40:15.740
How did I not gain weight, Brother?

613
40:15.740 --> 40:17.570
You just have a big face left,

614
40:17.820 --> 40:19.220
but no meat on your body.

615
40:21.280 --> 40:22.110
Brother.

616
40:22.260 --> 40:24.040
What happened to your neck?

617
40:24.070 --> 40:25.070
Don't mention it.

618
40:25.070 --> 40:27.070
I was helping a fellow villager thresh highland barley,

619
40:27.070 --> 40:28.440
and the yak got spooked.

620
40:28.550 --> 40:30.030
I managed to catch the yak,

621
40:30.050 --> 40:31.730
but it headbutted me

622
40:31.950 --> 40:33.210
and I sprained my neck.

623
40:33.330 --> 40:33.860
Brother.

624
40:33.960 --> 40:34.760
Sit down, sit down.

625
40:34.760 --> 40:34.960
Okay.

626
40:34.960 --> 40:35.900
Let me rub it for you.

627
40:35.900 --> 40:36.780
Come.

628
40:38.630 --> 40:40.280
No, no, go lower.

629
40:40.300 --> 40:41.610
Yes, yes, right here.

630
40:42.180 --> 40:44.280
You've grown taller in the past half year,

631
40:44.280 --> 40:46.230
and you've gotten stronger in the hands too.

632
40:46.230 --> 40:47.280
Have you eaten today?

633
40:47.280 --> 40:49.130
I've been so busy today, I haven't had time.

634
40:49.130 --> 40:50.530
You haven't eaten today?

635
40:50.530 --> 40:51.690
I have some roasted flour here.

636
40:51.690 --> 40:53.670
How can you not eat?

637
40:55.320 --> 40:56.880
Delicious roasted flour.

638
40:59.480 --> 41:00.610
Tastes good, right?

639
41:01.890 --> 41:02.660
Let me do it.

640
41:03.030 --> 41:03.700
Quick, help me pick it up.

641
41:03.700 --> 41:05.030
You eat, I'll pick it up!

642
41:05.320 --> 41:06.320
It's okay.

643
41:06.320 --> 41:06.920
Let me do it.

644
41:06.920 --> 41:07.400
Okay.

645
41:07.400 --> 41:08.360
You...

646
41:08.800 --> 41:09.200
You...

647
41:10.530 --> 41:11.380
Be careful.

648
41:11.460 --> 41:12.540
Come on.

649
41:14.150 --> 41:14.800
Are you okay, fellow villager?

650
41:14.800 --> 41:15.630
I'm fine.

651
41:15.720 --> 41:16.720
Are you okay?

652
41:16.750 --> 41:17.580
No problem.

653
41:18.550 --> 41:19.430
Be careful.

654
41:19.460 --> 41:21.180
Come, have some water first.

655
41:21.590 --> 41:23.400
Ximei, who is he to you?

656
41:23.590 --> 41:24.850
Why is he so nice to you?

657
41:25.000 --> 41:26.260
He's my older brother.

658
41:26.280 --> 41:26.960
Ximei,

659
41:26.980 --> 41:27.960
you have such an old brother?

660
41:27.960 --> 41:29.650
I don't believe it!

661
41:29.770 --> 41:31.120
What's not to believe?

662
41:31.400 --> 41:33.190
I really am her biological brother.

663
41:33.190 --> 41:34.510
She is my biological sister.

664
41:34.510 --> 41:35.240
Really?

665
41:35.330 --> 41:36.770
Why would I lie to you?

666
41:38.630 --> 41:39.230
Brother, don't move.

667
41:39.230 --> 41:39.830
Okay.

668
41:40.190 --> 41:40.880
Okay.

669
41:41.950 --> 41:42.700
Look.

670
41:44.150 --> 41:44.360
Look.

671
41:44.360 --> 41:45.050
-It's true. -It's true.

672
41:45.050 --> 41:46.680
This is what our mother left us.

673
41:46.680 --> 41:48.710
A longevity lock to lock in longevity,

674
41:48.710 --> 41:50.770
live to a hundred and never separate!

675
41:51.000 --> 41:51.710
Ximei,

676
41:51.770 --> 41:53.190
come here and help me!

677
41:53.710 --> 41:54.320
Coming!

678
41:54.340 --> 41:55.650
You keep it, brother.

679
41:56.070 --> 41:57.400
Finish the flour!

680
41:58.100 --> 41:59.070
This kid...

681
42:01.990 --> 42:03.390
She has grown quite a bit.

682
42:03.860 --> 42:04.570
Good.

683
42:13.210 --> 42:15.480
We established the Northwest Federal Government

684
42:15.480 --> 42:16.510
to build

685
42:16.670 --> 42:18.780
the center of revolutionary struggle in the Northwest.

686
42:18.780 --> 42:20.440
Developing from this center,

687
42:21.030 --> 42:21.950
we can

688
42:21.980 --> 42:24.140
take Chengdu and Chongqing to the south,

689
42:23.550 --> 42:26.730
[Zhang Guotao, Member of the Standing Committee of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee; Chairman of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission]

690
42:24.320 --> 42:26.230
capture Shaanxi and Gansu to the north,

691
42:26.230 --> 42:29.030
and go straight to Qinghai and Xinjiang to the west.

692
42:28.930 --> 42:31.970
[Chen Changhao, Political Commissar of the 4th Front Army]

693
42:29.670 --> 42:30.510
In this way,

694
42:30.700 --> 42:32.470
we will grasp the strategic initiative,

695
42:32.470 --> 42:34.440
and for welcoming the Central Red Army

696
42:34.440 --> 42:36.320
and opening up broader base areas,

697
42:36.320 --> 42:37.840
it lays a solid foundation.

698
42:37.840 --> 42:38.590
Changhao,

699
42:39.000 --> 42:40.400
we are on the same page.

700
42:40.920 --> 42:42.880
Is there any news from the Central Red Army?

701
42:42.880 --> 42:43.360
Yes,

702
42:43.410 --> 42:44.470
and it's good news.

703
42:45.050 --> 42:47.260
The enemy's newspaper just published

704
42:47.630 --> 42:49.700
that a few days ago, the Central Red Army

705
42:49.700 --> 42:51.640
successfully crossed the natural barrier of the Dadu River,

706
42:51.640 --> 42:53.310
and will join forces with us soon.

707
42:53.310 --> 42:54.020
Good.

708
42:54.470 --> 42:55.930
Great, that's wonderful!

709
42:55.960 --> 42:57.960
We should send someone to meet them.

710
42:59.250 --> 43:00.250
Xiangqian.

711
42:59.680 --> 43:00.740
[Xu Xiangqian, Commander-in-Chief of the 4th Front Army]

712
43:01.220 --> 43:03.010
We are on the same page this time.
